{"ID":"20230925135449-teb0ayf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20230925135449-teb0ayf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925135449-teb0ayf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925145338-bdz1uwh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925152255-xx58u83\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:6045,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925152255-xx58u83\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20240906134330"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925145338-tkxonbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-tkxonbn","updated":"20230925150522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、造酒的时候，是上面那层液体蒸馏出酒，所以酒可以「引诸药至至高之分」，而下面的余渣最底下可以提炼出麦芽糖，因此饴糖（麦芽糖）的药性除了补脾胃之外，更可说是把桂枝汤的药性黏住，然后压到腹部以及肚脐以下。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-s4mzei3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-s4mzei3","updated":"20230925150528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、小肠和心相表里"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-b4ypvkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-b4ypvkf","updated":"20230925150531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、小建中汤五脏皆补"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mmm982f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mmm982f","updated":"20230925150549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、风伤卫，寒伤营"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rggcttg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rggcttg","updated":"20230925150552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、痰，水也，随火而上升。龙（龙骨）属阳而潜于海，能引逆上之火、泛滥之水，下归其宅。若与牡蛎同用，为治痰之神品。今人止知其性涩以收脱，何其浅也。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ahd3uax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ahd3uax","updated":"20230925150553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、能切换神经的代表药是生半夏(交感神经切换到副交感神经)"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rcqwxyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rcqwxyy","updated":"20230925150555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、古方以豆豉发感冒；当感冒病邪在体内时，豆豉能把肾气充塞全身，并把病邪逼出去。（加葱白，帮助发汗。形成葱豉汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rmypbma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rmypbma","updated":"20230925150556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、肺藏魄、肝藏魂、心藏神、肾藏志、脾藏意；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-okjfn8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-okjfn8c","updated":"20230925150559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、三焦，在我们中国人的观点里，用一个最模糊的认识来说，像是人体里面有一个很大的腑，这个腑是什么？是贯串人体所有五脏六腑，形成一个能量的网，好像是把所有的五脏六腑都关在一个笼子里；好像「五脏六腑是结在三焦这棵树干上的果实」一样的这种感觉。至于三焦是肉体的存在？还是灵魂的存在？这个是有争议的，我们姑且不论。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-etl4642","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-etl4642","updated":"20230925150600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.1、就是三焦它所代表的形而上的意义就是，人体的表面是有一层模子的，这一层包围着我们人体的这个气场，或许我们的十二经络都是走在这个模子上的，就是我们人体有一个灵魂的表面，那经络是走在这个灵魂的表面上。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ttjel2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ttjel2k","updated":"20230925150602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.2、命门生出无形的三焦，肚脐吸收营养生出有形的肉身"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-u8qy0e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-u8qy0e4","updated":"20230925150603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.3、三焦是水谷之道路，气之所终始也；上焦者，在心下，在胃上口，主内而不出；（就是说上焦作用是主收纳元气，不让它出去）；而营气是从中焦来的，卫气则是从下焦来的；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zb03t6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zb03t6e","updated":"20230925150604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.4、上焦如雾，中焦如沤，下焦如渎；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-z2dr12c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-z2dr12c","updated":"20231008085001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤主结构：柴胡、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-t1dl1e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-t1dl1e6","updated":"20231008085003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小青龙汤主结构：桂枝、甘草、芍药、细辛、干姜、五味子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mhelvum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mhelvum","updated":"20230925150608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、腠理：张仲景有解释，「腠者，是三焦通会元真之处，为血气所注」；身体里面的元气的运转，是透过我们的三焦，在我们身体里面这些通气的缝隙；「理者，是皮肤脏腑之文理也」，「理」的话，是皮肤脏腑的缝隙，大概是这样。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-av9frm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-av9frm7","updated":"20230925150609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、气街：大概而言，一般的假设是：人体的气有一个网络，用形而上的观点看三焦的时候，会觉得三焦就是人的身体里一个气的流动的场域，这个场域是从膀胱、命门那个地方有能量升上来，然后经过所谓的三焦，汇聚在人的胸口，变成胸中大气，胸中大气凝聚到够了，再透过肺的肃降的力量，然后从人的身体前面走到脚，这个降下来的气的流动叫作「气街」。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-hatelua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-hatelua","updated":"20230925150610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13.1、内经说人身上有四个气街，分别在头、胸、腹、脚；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-wnz0h09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-wnz0h09","updated":"20230925150611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、在古中医经典里，有句话说「三焦，其腑在气街」，三焦里的气，跟气街的气是一对的──三焦是相对的阴，气街是相对的阳。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1al9wig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1al9wig","updated":"20230925150612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、瞑眩反应：如麻黄汤出鼻血、真武汤吐水或拉水、柴胡汤先冷到剧烈发抖，然后又一阵热，最后身体出汗后恢复等；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dke6hff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dke6hff","updated":"20230925150613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、大喜伤心；大恐伤肾；大怒伤肝；大悲伤肺；大思伤脾；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ucjcj6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ucjcj6g","updated":"20230925150614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、肝（木）心（火）脾（土）肺（金）肾（水）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-x7dke7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-x7dke7f","updated":"20230925150615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17.1、酸（肝）苦（心）甜（脾）辛（肺）咸（肾）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-r330bsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-r330bsw","updated":"20230925150616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、肝藏魂、心藏神、脾藏意、肺藏魄、肾藏志"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-hhd10dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-hhd10dk","updated":"20230925150617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18.1、肝主筋，肾主骨，脾主肉，心主脉，肺主皮毛"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ypso3ew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ypso3ew","updated":"20230925150618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、春夏养阳，秋冬养阴"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1oomoj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1oomoj1","updated":"20230925150621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、金生水生木生火生土生金，金克木克土克水克火克金"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kwvo9vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kwvo9vm","updated":"20230925150624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、吃补药会上火，说明脾胃寒，可以尝试持续服用厚朴温中汤暖脾胃再补"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4va1a73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4va1a73","updated":"20230925150626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、心脏是阳中之阳，肺脏是阳中之阴，脾脏是阴中之阴，肾脏是阴中之阳。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-gzui186","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-gzui186","updated":"20230925150626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、人的头脸是诸阳之会"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0l7xzda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0l7xzda","updated":"20230925150627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、咳嗽最后收工是脾肾，不是在肺"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rfn9r5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rfn9r5h","updated":"20230925150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、五脏，阳实则顺生，阴实则逆生（例：脾胃（土）之阳充足就生肺阳（金），肝（木）阴实会逆向生成肾（水）阴实）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-qfnqe4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-qfnqe4o","updated":"20230925150629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25.1、五脏，阳虚则正克，阴虚则倒克（例：肝（木）阳虚会克成脾（土）阳虚，肺（金）阴虚会倒克成心（火）阴虚）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dnaaezi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dnaaezi","updated":"20230925150630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、当体内有很多痰，而我们的肾很虚的时候，治痰要从补肾开始"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-hts22vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-hts22vj","updated":"20230925150631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、发狂就要通大便，基本思路"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-y9ufz98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-y9ufz98","updated":"20230925150632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、癫与狂区别：神志不清叫做癫，猛烈，猛爆性行为叫做狂；癫比较是痰迷心窍之类的病，狂比较是大便密结，因为燥热而形成的病；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7bmrkgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7bmrkgw","updated":"20230925150633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、心主血，脾统血，肝藏血，肾主五液"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0y0bugs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0y0bugs","updated":"20230925150634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.1、心有生血的功能，饮食物经过脾胃的运化，化为水谷之精气，再化为营气和津液进入脉中，经过心火的作用，化为赤色血液，即所谓“浊气归心，淫气于脉。”此其一。二是指心气能推动血液运行，输送营养物质于全身脏腑形体官窍。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-y8h9n7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-y8h9n7h","updated":"20230925150653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.2、脾气具有统摄、控制血液在脉中正常运行而不逸出脉外的作用，脾气统摄血液实际上是气的固摄作用的体现；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-r7p8gev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-r7p8gev","updated":"20230925150658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.3、肝具有储藏血液、调节血量和防止出血的功能。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ujcq2k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ujcq2k8","updated":"20230925150659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.4、肝脏储存营养；心脏用血液把营养送出去，经脉流动时，又需要肺来相助，因为肺一呼一吸能够让百脉流动；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-oib39p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-oib39p8","updated":"20230925150700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、抗癌开药原则，九补一攻。就是补药要占到九分，攻击药只占到一分。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-eb2gkbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-eb2gkbk","updated":"20230925150701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、百脉朝肺"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ftzu41g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ftzu41g","updated":"20231008084945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"补肾的地黄只要有麦门冬配合，特别容易入肾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5mf0ae0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5mf0ae0","updated":"20230925150703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、风水：皮肤底下受了风邪，把水气勾留在皮肤底下导致皮肤肿态的状况；也可以说是体内水毒跟风邪勾在一起，然后被约束在皮肤表面；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-36gozdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-36gozdf","updated":"20230925150707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、肺痈：痈就是化脓长脓包，肺痈就是肺在发炎化脓，然后脓包破了之后喷脓喷血"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zwt76ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zwt76ph","updated":"20230925150708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34.1、肺萎：肺萎缩掉了，纤维化；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pyq6ai1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pyq6ai1","updated":"20230925150709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34.2、用阴阳虚实来说，肺痈是实热的发炎化脓，属阳实证；肺萎是肺部干缩掉了，属阴虚证；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-bczct2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-bczct2c","updated":"20230925150710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34.3、肺萎也是会吐大量的痰，而且痰是粘稠的；（肺干缩导致功能异常，无法分配津液导致津液被肺热蒸上来变成粘稠的痰）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-gnqwvvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-gnqwvvw","updated":"20231008085433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"川穹：厥阴经引经药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-we83rst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-we83rst","updated":"20231008085453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡仁和败酱草一起用，脓就会被身体吸收分解掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-znhc0wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-znhc0wl","updated":"20230925150712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、肺胀：上气，喘而躁者，属肺胀；气吸不进来，又喘又觉得人烦躁。（类似西医病名肺气肿）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-yd6mh0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-yd6mh0j","updated":"20231008102017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四物汤：当归、川穹、白芍、地黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-qe1wrez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-qe1wrez","updated":"20231008102018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆汤：甘草、干姜、附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-g3n0fzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-g3n0fzy","updated":"20231008102020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆散：柴胡、芍药、枳实、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rhsts8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rhsts8t","updated":"20231008102021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四君子汤：人参、茯苓、白术、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5u5f4qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5u5f4qf","updated":"20231008102023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.4、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"五味异功散：四君子汤加味陈皮；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-twns0lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-twns0lz","updated":"20231008102024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"六君子汤：五味异功散加味半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2c4xwy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2c4xwy7","updated":"20230925150721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、张仲景两大滋阴补血方：炙甘草汤、朱鸟汤（黄连阿胶鸡子黄汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kbiomwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kbiomwb","updated":"20230925150729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、结脉：两个跳动扭曲装成一个跳动，不规律的状况，可以称之为结脉，就是脉打结的那种感觉"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1b98ig5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1b98ig5","updated":"20230925150730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40.1、代脉：正常跳动，中间突然少跳一下的脉；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-43wrcxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-43wrcxc","updated":"20230925150731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40.2、促脉：跟代脉一样的症状，但速度要比正常的脉跳得急，跳得快；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pwkf6bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pwkf6bv","updated":"20230925150732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40.3、数脉：跳得快的脉；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9rcv8z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9rcv8z4","updated":"20230925150732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、赤石脂补髓，天门冬强骨髓，干漆，芝麻，胡麻的叶子，牛骨髓填脑髓，地黄补骨髓"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6ep78ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6ep78ks","updated":"20230925150733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、中国医家认为，很会吸地力的药，一个是地黄，一个是麻仁。地黄滋阴分之阴，麻仁滋阳分之阴。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0hpjln4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0hpjln4","updated":"20230925150734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、酸枣仁让肝脾心三经引血归心的药，让三脏比较有血；柏子仁润肠通便兼补肝虚；麻子仁适用于肺萎润肺；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kg4iurd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kg4iurd","updated":"20230925150803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、阳气虚的人不太能吃滋阴药，需先补阳再滋阴；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rsew9ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rsew9ig","updated":"20230925150834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、补肾药酉时吃（傍晚5-7点）更有效（以十二经脉循行时间来看，酉时是肾脏，所以肾脏时间吃补肾药更有效；以阴阳角度看，黄昏是要入阴的时间点，所以补阴药，在黄昏吃较有效）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fo5pozf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fo5pozf","updated":"20230925150907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、五运六气：其实是两个东西的循环，分为五运和六气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-463jttd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-463jttd","updated":"20230925150954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.1、五运的循环是每十年一个周期，某一年的火特别旺，某一年的火特别虚，某一年木特别旺，某一年木特别虚，就是这样子一个五行乘以2的10个变化："}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-l43jgzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-l43jgzr","updated":"20230925150955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.2、六气，就是风、暑、湿、燥、寒、火这六气。如果换一个话讲就是，少阴君火（光），少阳相火（热），厥阴风木，太阳寒水，太阴湿土，阳明燥金，这六种气的轮回，又分为主气跟客气。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-wpxnyig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-wpxnyig","updated":"20230925150956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.3、五行配五季，即春（木）、夏（火）、长夏季（土）、秋（金）、冬（水）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zm2u7ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zm2u7ib","updated":"20230925150957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.4、（主气）六气将一年分六段，厥阴风木之气，少阴君火之气、少阳相火之气、太阴湿土之气、阳明燥金之气、太阳寒水之气（五行相生顺序，木火土金水）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-b4ol6po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-b4ol6po","updated":"20230925150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46.5、（客气）六气阴阳分类，三阳是太阳，二阳阳明，一阳少阳，三阴太阴，二阴少阴，一阴厥阴；它好像有一个轮盘，每年转一下，它会每年有一个东西呢占最主导的位置，称之为这一年的客气之中的‘司天’，这个轮盘中，与司天相对称的为‘在泉’。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-3zz2mr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-3zz2mr8","updated":"20230925150959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、火神派认为，补阳药里并不是加了甘草就变成中焦药，而是加了甘草后能够让阳以一个更稳定的状态在命门里面持续燃烧；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9egkc69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9egkc69","updated":"20230925151000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、甘澜水：普通水经过击打，变成有很多泡沫的状态的一种水；蒸馏水也可以替代之；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-82pxt0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-82pxt0h","updated":"20230925151001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、当归跟芍药是相对的，生血用当归（把血从肝脏放出），养血用芍药（把血收回肝脏）。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-u7zwwua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-u7zwwua","updated":"20230925151002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、破瘀血：红花桃仁、大黄、水蛭跟虻虫跟蟅虫跟蛴螬（四虫）、干漆；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zc3it59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zc3it59","updated":"20231008114327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"头痛常见引经药：太阳经蔓荆子\\羌活\\藁本；阳明经白芷；少阳经柴胡；太阴经苍术；少阴经细辛；厥阴经吴茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-jf6g7cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-jf6g7cc","updated":"20230925151004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、伤寒论中张仲景用的桂枝，可能不是现在用的桂枝或桂枝尖，有可能是烂肉桂（JT）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-o4uw8oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-o4uw8oy","updated":"20230925151005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、痰饮：如果一个人肥人突然瘦了，可是不肥之后他的肠子咕咕直响，那说明之前让他肥的水都掉到肚子里面去，这称之为痰饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-he4x0r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-he4x0r1","updated":"20230925151007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.1、悬饮：如果这个水是流到肋骨，咳嗽时有扯痛感，就好像那个痰饮是悬挂在那边，扯在那边，就叫悬饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-eumfhpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-eumfhpt","updated":"20230925151008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.2、溢饮：如果水气散到手脚，当汗不汗，就是本来发汗这些多余死水会随这个汗水出去，可是你又没有发汗成功，就身体、手脚周边一点点在痛，那这就叫溢饮，就是满出去的水就叫溢饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pttezua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pttezua","updated":"20230925151009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.3、支饮：如果水塞在这个隔膜的地方，然后让人呼吸不顺畅，然后人有点水肿，那这就叫做支饮，就是塞在某个部位，像一条树枝横在那边一样；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-m103z2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-m103z2x","updated":"20230925151010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.4、水在心，则心下坚筑，短气，恶水不欲饮；水在肺，必吐涎沫，欲饮水；水在脾，则少气身重；水在肝，则胁下支满，嚏则胁痛；水在肾，则心下悸。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-s9ddr71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-s9ddr71","updated":"20230925151011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53.5、舒驰远的理脾涤饮方称统治五饮诸症，实际确实有效，也可以替代仲景方试试；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-t302k1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-t302k1c","updated":"20230925151011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、中焦水循环不良-苓桂术甘汤，下焦或全身水循环不良-五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-f7de706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-f7de706","updated":"20230925151012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、烦躁的原因之一：里面有热导致烦躁"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8suk4x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8suk4x6","updated":"20230925151013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55.1、烦躁的原因之二：阳气不能摆脱阴邪的纠缠"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kt9exl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kt9exl5","updated":"20230925151018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、水精：古人认为水里面也是有精气营养的；称之为水精"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-s2f5mu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-s2f5mu7","updated":"20230925151023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56.1、水精是怎么进入人体的？水先喝到胃里，然后胃里水精开始散布，上去给脾，然后脾再去散精，然后再把这个营气归给肺，同时通调水道，就是我们身体里面需要的水会从水道走。古医书里面水道是指狭义的三焦，即有形的淋巴系统；然后水还会给膀胱，那给膀胱有什么作用呢？就是膀胱我们说跟命门连通才有气化功能，它是能够拉住这个水精之气，然后去散布到全身。故黄帝内经有言：水精四布，下输膀胱。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4w6l40q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4w6l40q","updated":"20230925151045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、汉朝，换算单位中，两之下的单位是铢，1两等于24铢；18铢是3/4两；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uoldvb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uoldvb1","updated":"20230925151047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57.1、晋朝，铢和两之间多了一个‘分’，1两等于4分，1分等于6铢，1两就是24铢；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dqq5kxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dqq5kxb","updated":"20230925151050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、茯苓：让无形的水精之气从上传，偏阳刚；猪苓：有形的水从三焦淋巴上来，偏阴柔；泽泻：让体内有水的部分水中阴浊之邪拔除；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-wcalsm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-wcalsm4","updated":"20230925151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、松树底下菌类叫茯苓（利小便）；枫树底下菌类叫猪苓（利水道）；竹子底下菌类叫雷丸；泽泻（消水）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-f0ydmuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-f0ydmuy","updated":"20230925151052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、栀子泻郁火；较形而上的火，药性向下；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5rjm8ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5rjm8ki","updated":"20230925151053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60.1、连翘泻血分之火；将火从皮肤表面逼出，药性向外"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rggp6ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rggp6ym","updated":"20230925151054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60.2、牡丹皮泻阴中之火；什么地方越阴越能泻（相对的，例脏腑相比脏比较阴；也可说流动属阳，固定属阴），如泻骨头发炎，泻骨头的火；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0g98hls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0g98hls","updated":"20230925151055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、交心肾药味：栀子和豆豉；肉桂（点燃命门火）和黄连（降心火）；栀子和乌梅（口生津液）；菖蒲和远志（防健忘）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-85t5mlx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-85t5mlx","updated":"20230925151056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61.2、调体制，跟任何方子都几乎没有冲突的四个组合：黄连和肉桂；半夏和夏枯草；半夏和秫米；夜交藤（何首乌的苗）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-o04kuhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-o04kuhk","updated":"20230925151056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、尿毒症铁三角：生姜、附子、大黄；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8nczj32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8nczj32","updated":"20231008135911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、心欲软，食盐以软之；"}]},{"ID":"20230925151838-8si3exc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925151838-8si3exc","updated":"20231008135912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、阳气充足时，可以吃些滋阴药来收敛阳气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mz7zl79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mz7zl79","updated":"20231008135936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、让一个人交感神经切换副交感神经，最有效的药是生半夏；加一撮小米或薏米，就是加味半夏秫米汤结构，可放松身心，降低性欲；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0mgk2ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0mgk2ai","updated":"20231008135952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、麻黄九禁：咽（干）、淋（小便不利或小便涩痛）、疮（皮肤溃烂长疮）、衄（流鼻血）、血（失血）、汗（出汗）、寒（体寒）、心悸、脉迟微；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ansotje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ansotje","updated":"20231008140031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.1、咽喉干燥者不可发汗"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ir0lwmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ir0lwmq","updated":"20231008140032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.2、淋家不可发汗，发汗必便血"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-z0cutzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-z0cutzy","updated":"20231008140033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.3、疮家，虽身疼痛，不可发汗，汗出则痙（抽筋）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-t9sg0gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-t9sg0gq","updated":"20231008140036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.4、衄家不可发汗，汗出必额上陷，脉当紧；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4voh2wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4voh2wl","updated":"20231008140037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.5、亡血家，不可发汗，发汗则寒栗而振；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5gfml64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5gfml64","updated":"20231008140041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.6、汗家重发汗（不止发一次汗），与禹余粮丸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2u9xhm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2u9xhm7","updated":"20231008140042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66.7、有寒，复发汗，胃中冷，必吐逆（必吐蛔）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uih6sxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uih6sxi","updated":"20231008140044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、卫气出于三焦，三焦出于命门；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-icebt1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-icebt1a","updated":"20231008140049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、禹余粮：河里面的石头，打破后里面黄色的粉状物；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-a9w5p1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-a9w5p1v","updated":"20231008140050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、太乙余粮：山顶山谷里面的石头，打破后里面黄色的粉状物；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-oa6bmm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-oa6bmm7","updated":"20231008140051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、麻黄汤暝眩：喷血；真武汤暝眩：喷水；小柴胡汤暝眩：忽冷忽热，颤抖冒汗或眼前一黑，再而痊愈；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uv7a8k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uv7a8k2","updated":"20231008140052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、眩：感觉天旋地转而不能平衡的感觉；冒：眼发黑头发重眼冒金星；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-xf8192f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-xf8192f","updated":"20231008140053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、少阳区块包括了胆和三焦；（足少阳胆经和手少阳三焦经）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-we3rusi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-we3rusi","updated":"20231008140055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72.1、少阳，往来寒热，热多寒少；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2ke63ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2ke63ss","updated":"20231008140059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72.2、胆者，中正之官，决断出焉，《内经》；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-he9m8yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-he9m8yl","updated":"20231008144134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72.3、三焦者，决渎之官，水道出焉《黄帝内经》；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-xmvhru8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-xmvhru8","updated":"20231008144135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、小阳旦汤：桂、芍、草、姜、枣（治表有风邪）；小阴旦汤：芩、芍、草、姜、枣（治里有风邪）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pzjdx7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pzjdx7s","updated":"20231008144136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、正阳旦汤：桂枝汤加一味饴糖（《辅行诀》）；小建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-yir9ltm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-yir9ltm","updated":"20231008144200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.2、大阳旦汤（补三焦）：正阳旦汤芍药加倍，再加饴糖与黄芪；黄芪建中汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ybekpvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ybekpvg","updated":"20231008144202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.3、大阴旦汤（清三焦）：小柴胡汤"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-hjtz8yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-hjtz8yp","updated":"20231008144203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、天行病：上天要你流行的病，就是传染病；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-vm0z81g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-vm0z81g","updated":"20231008144204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、练气功出错气乱窜，打掉重练：柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-b93vjsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-b93vjsf","updated":"20231008144208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、柴胡汤证会 心烦喜呕的原因，虽然太阳会呕，阳明也会呕，少阴也可能会呕，为什么张仲景喜欢用呕来标注少阳病？是因为少阳病的小柴胡汤证，容易跟太阳阳明太阴合并，两经一起病的话，消化系统基本就没有能量了，所以容易呕吐。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-l399bqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-l399bqn","updated":"20231008144301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76.1、一个被误下后体虚的人或本身就虚的人，小柴胡汤也能用，但会有冥眩反应，需提前告知病人。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-k866dfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-k866dfq","updated":"20231008144302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、太阳恶寒，阳明恶热，少阳往来寒热；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-tg1tacj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-tg1tacj","updated":"20231008144333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、在本草领域，有人认为，柴胡和半夏能形成一个相对的结构，因为柴胡是春天长出来的，是一年里面从阴转阳的时候的药物，半夏是这个夏天到一半就采收的东西，是天地之间从阳转阴的药物。所以两者在柴胡汤里面运作时起到人的脑中开关的机能；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fv1x1ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fv1x1ly","updated":"20231008144327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、每个人都有他适合学的东西，比如眼睛好可望诊，耳朵好可听诊，思路敏捷可读医经，理解医理做研究，耐心好手巧则可以学艾灸，如果是心调和筋骨柔软，可以做导引，就是帮人按摩之类的；如果一个人嘴很毒，可以叫他唾痈咒病，就是诅咒病邪以驱邪；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kkw8p3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kkw8p3d","updated":"20231008144413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、人体气是从左边上升，右边下降；（验证：如身体侧面胁痛，在左边，开柴胡，就是帮助三焦气上升；如果在右边，开枳壳陈皮之类，帮助这个气下降）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-g97hg2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-g97hg2s","updated":"20231008144414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80.1、左血右气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-bdz1uwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-bdz1uwh","updated":"20231008144416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、咽门者，是肝胆之候；如果肝脏热，喉咙就会塞，如果胆腑寒这个人就会失声；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-bajvbqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-bajvbqv","updated":"20231008144417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、一个人的骨髓跟肝胆是有关系的，骨髓虚，脑痛不安，骨髓实，人会比较勇敢；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7jhb9l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7jhb9l6","updated":"20231008144418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、伤寒论，日本那边认为康平治本比较权威，中国认为赵开美本比较权威；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-eqrrgr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-eqrrgr5","updated":"20231008144420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、少阳区块疾病主要重点：不可以吐下，不可以汗解，不可以尿解；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-f8z7xah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-f8z7xah","updated":"20231008144546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛只是能够入汤煮的药，而不是能做药散的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lsca4yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lsca4yp","updated":"20231008144422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、柴胡汤拿来治阳痿效果非常好，基本上任何一种柴胡剂治疗阳痿的效果通常远胜于补肾药，因为性器官是足厥阴经在管，所以要用疏肝药把足厥阴经打通，才能让阳痿好转----JT"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0qa48qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0qa48qc","updated":"20231008144635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、温胆汤虽然 不能平替张仲景的方，但温胆汤却可以做到张仲景的柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤、四逆散、小柴胡汤这些方子七成的力道，且没太大的副作用，可久服；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-783l9xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-783l9xd","updated":"20231008144636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、汤剂中，薄荷要后放，因为薄荷煮久了会没效；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5ipy42t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5ipy42t","updated":"20231008144754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、疏肝药中，柴胡效果并不是最强，反而是陈皮青皮（绿色桔子皮）代表最强的疏肝药是羚羊角，，治乳癌肝癌时，用青皮，舒肝、破肝阴实效果比柴胡强非常多（需配合补肝药镇住，不然人会被打伤）；其次论破气的效果，枳实厚朴比柴胡强；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-brbgn94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-brbgn94","updated":"20231008144755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、人不管哪里上火都会跟肝火连在一起，因为人身上气的升降，肝胆之气是上升的，火的性质就是要上升的，所以它一定会往它同类的方向去走。所以不管哪一脏的火都会跟肝火结合在一起，且不区分虚火实火；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-omifyrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-omifyrx","updated":"20231008144804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、左胁痛，涉及肝经；右胁痛，涉及肺经；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dema9w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dema9w8","updated":"20231008144805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、一般来说，所有的火症都跟肝胆有关系，所以他要退火就要以肝胆为主，再加一点各个经的需要用的退火药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8epgar0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8epgar0","updated":"20231008144806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、心火用黄连，胃火用石膏，肾火用黄柏知母，肺火用黄芩，大肠火用地榆，小肠火用天麦冬；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9n12bb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9n12bb0","updated":"20231008144822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、关格：指一个人上面吃不进东西，下面大小便不出来状态；傅青主、陈世铎他们认为关格这东西可以有调理去处理，就这是肝胆之气的问题，因为肝胆之气卡在那边，所以人才会关格；（不要跟肠梗搞混）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-rd654sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-rd654sn","updated":"20231008144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、虚劳发热：补中益气汤；逍遥散或加味逍遥散（发热比较严重，到血分）；柴胡清骨散（发热到骨头）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-g1b3m5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-g1b3m5l","updated":"20231008145020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪海厦不是讲过汤如荡吗？像扫荡一样把外邪给驱逐出体外，散剂治四肢久病、风、湿、痹更好， 丸剂治积治虫，特点是药缓力专"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lf73czc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lf73czc","updated":"20231008145003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、仲景方里面，凡是名字带有建中二字的，一定有麦芽糖；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9wvgbnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9wvgbnq","updated":"20231008145023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、经方中，补肝第一方，就是小建中汤；----曹颖甫"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-x255osx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-x255osx","updated":"20231008145024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、肝胆主疏泄；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lxg29zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lxg29zd","updated":"20231008145025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、牡蛎是把气收回血液里面，龙骨是把气收回整个人的轮廓里面；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-sc5j8r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-sc5j8r1","updated":"20231008145034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"水蛭是一个会让人终止怀孕的药，所以怀孕期间，不适合吃水蛭"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6alzevz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6alzevz","updated":"20231008145026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、张仲景用药四虫：水蛭和牤虫（以破淤化淤为主）；蛴螬（金龟子幼虫；治到肝和眼睛）；土鳖虫（除了破瘀外，最主要的效力是修补）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6pskduq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6pskduq","updated":"20231008145027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、磁石补肾，但会干肺，因为磁石会抽肺的气去补肾；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6oawcud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6oawcud","updated":"20231008145128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"纯粹黄芪剂单用人会腰酸，因为它会把肾脏的气抽调一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5e3fax5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5e3fax5","updated":"20231008145029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112.1、黄芪虽补肺气，但不润，所以用黄芪补气同时要辅药润肺；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-af6bq0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-af6bq0g","updated":"20231008145030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、黄芪对润养脾胃效果不大，但对脾胃营养的输布比较有效果；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-cerwmny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-cerwmny","updated":"20231008145140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113.1、黄芪跟当归走，附子跟黄芪走；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-f7bbbmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-f7bbbmd","updated":"20231008145141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113.2、黄芪药味要久服才能断根；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-l8t6l7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-l8t6l7v","updated":"20231008145222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"轻量黄芪能止汗（固表），中量黄芪利尿去水肿，大量黄芪则汗孔打开（元气够所以不怕邪气，毛孔大开，活血通经）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dexqxvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dexqxvd","updated":"20231008145203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、小建中汤心、肝、肾、脾都补，肺补的会比较少；如果要肺也补，可以加味生姜和半夏；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6mfz8o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6mfz8o8","updated":"20231008145203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、仲景用黄芩有三偶：柴胡（气分热结者）；芍药（血分热结者）；黄连（湿热阻中者）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4ujanq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4ujanq1","updated":"20231008145326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾气丸是收纳肝脾肾三经之阳气，酸枣仁汤是养心肝脾三脏之血，所以酸枣仁汤跟肾气丸是成对的存在"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-nwgxm79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-nwgxm79","updated":"20231008145205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、大黄蛰虫丸是慢慢化开淤住的地方，薯蓣丸是慢慢补同时带有微微祛风驱邪的药，两者也是成对的存在；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-m5nn0xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-m5nn0xr","updated":"20231008145452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小建中汤中，芍药可以减量，唯独麦芽糖不能减量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fvx34ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fvx34ka","updated":"20231008145457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"破解补药较强的东西：白萝卜、绿豆皮、空心菜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-m28oar3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-m28oar3","updated":"20231008145511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"春天不宜补肝，肝容易受伤（从西医角度来说，人类身体很多废物要在春天排出来，所以春天肝脏倒垃圾倒的很辛苦，活动的最剧烈的一个季节。而这时候拼命灌输有营养的东西，会导致肝过于疲惫坏掉；所以，春天疏肝最好，不要补肝）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zfqy2x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zfqy2x5","updated":"20231008145210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、肾气丸如长期吃，可以不要再加附子，可加味五味子或五味子与肉苁蓉之类更温柔的补药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-qul0sls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-qul0sls","updated":"20231008145413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、肾气丸分类法：肾阳太过或阳实用知柏丸，阴虚用六味丸，阳虚用八味丸，阴实用济生肾气丸（牛车肾气丸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0t4f722","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0t4f722","updated":"20231008145858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大泻汤五味药："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药、黄芩、姜、大黄、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"；----辅行诀，如转盘般轮换拼凑的药味"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-h5a9c2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-h5a9c2u","updated":"20231008145905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.1、泻肝：大泻汤加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uvw1o5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uvw1o5e","updated":"20231008145908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.2、泻心：大泻汤加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7usz6vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7usz6vq","updated":"20231008145910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.3、泻肺：大泻汤加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶苈子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-euu2c9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-euu2c9e","updated":"20231008145911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.4、泻脾：大泻汤加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1jb7a43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1jb7a43","updated":"20231008145912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123.5、泻肾：大泻汤加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-x4n10zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-x4n10zj","updated":"20231008145554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、小泻汤肝汤：枳实、芍药、生姜；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-cuvlft8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-cuvlft8","updated":"20231008145555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124.1、小泻心汤：黄芩、黄连、大黄；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-o4e9qjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-o4e9qjf","updated":"20231008145556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124.2、小泻脾汤：干姜、附子、甘草；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6uobf70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6uobf70","updated":"20231008145556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124.3、小泻肺汤：葶苈子、大黄、芍药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zb30bl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zb30bl2","updated":"20231008145557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124.4、小泻肾汤：茯苓、甘草、黄芩；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dexq784","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dexq784","updated":"20231008145920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124.5、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"总结：大泻汤基本五味药与泻五脏五味药进行轮盘配对"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-zaze13u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-zaze13u","updated":"20231008145952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、小补肝汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大枣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。桂枝、干姜、五味子；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-odc8tpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-odc8tpb","updated":"20231008145955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125.1、小补心汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"豆豉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。代赭石、旋覆花、竹叶；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8ztey5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8ztey5q","updated":"20231008145957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125.2、小补脾汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。人参、甘草、干姜；（理中汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2n6serh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2n6serh","updated":"20231008145958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125.3、小补肺汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。麦门冬、五味子、旋覆花；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-yrldv5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-yrldv5u","updated":"20231008145959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125.4、小补肾汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。地黄、竹叶、甘草；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9li8sc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9li8sc1","updated":"20231008145606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125.5、注：标红的是药剂结构上比较核心的药味；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mlndat3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mlndat3","updated":"20231008145607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、大补肾汤=小补肾汤+去大枣的小补肝汤；（水生木）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4sdmctr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4sdmctr","updated":"20231008145608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.1、大补肝汤=小补肝汤+去豆豉的小补心汤；（木生火）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-jcgst7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-jcgst7b","updated":"20231008145609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.2、大补心汤=小补心汤+去白术的小补脾汤；（火生土）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-io7w4xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-io7w4xr","updated":"20231008145610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.3、大补脾汤=小补脾汤+去细辛的小补肺汤；（土生金）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pblpive","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pblpive","updated":"20231008145611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126.4、大补肺汤=小补肺汤+去泽泻的小补肾汤；（金生水）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5byr9pc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5byr9pc","updated":"20231008150041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、肉类的消化不良用山楂，谷类消化不良用谷芽麦芽，其他消化不良用神曲红曲；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0w2z4qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0w2z4qk","updated":"20231008150043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、真武汤能把西医认为不可逆的症状化为可逆（如眼睛瞎、耳朵聋、糖尿病导致的脚无知觉等）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-b6ur46p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-b6ur46p","updated":"20231008150043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、所有中医典籍里面，只有张仲景的伤寒杂病论是处理你的中医的感知跟表现而不是思考；人类真正的功力是感知力跟表现力。----JT"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pju3o05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pju3o05","updated":"20231008150128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酸枣仁汤中，酸枣仁用于呵护营气走完子时（11-1点）胆经这一段，接下来川穹来接力赛，继续把营气打到肝经去走完这一段（1-3点）；呵护了人晚上四个小时的睡眠品质；所以酸枣仁汤治虚劳，是保证人在子时能睡觉，能睡觉才有疗愈可以讲，不然其他补药很难奏效；------JT"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0bakucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0bakucg","updated":"20231008150104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、中医说的定心气的‘二仁一子’结构：酸枣仁、柏子仁、五味子；宁心气，也能起到治早泄的作用；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-jpbicnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-jpbicnd","updated":"20231008150201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"清淤血药味对比：虻虫清淤血，像是一锤子把淤血打碎；水蛭清淤血，像小孩子舔棒棒糖，舔的越多棒棒糖终于就舔完了；大黄清淤血，像用大水去冲开一样；桃仁清淤血，像加润滑油让血能够顺利的滑出来；干漆清淤血，它对血有点像是刮掉的感觉，就是刮多了还把你组织刮破了，有种只攻不守的调调"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-74oe6mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-74oe6mv","updated":"20231008150139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、封髓丹：砂仁、黄柏、甘草（郑钦安郑火神方）；砂仁引气入丹田，甘草把药闷住且让黄柏药性不要太猛，用阴药收住阳气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-9wq3awz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-9wq3awz","updated":"20231008150140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133.1、三才封髓丹：天冬、地黄、人参（天、地、人）；调和水火，收纳真气；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kmuq1rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kmuq1rd","updated":"20231008150141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133.2、封髓丹作用：肾阳外脱乱烧，需要用药把肾阳吸纳进来，光是用阳药引阳有时候效果不佳；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-jljjtt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-jljjtt6","updated":"20231008150142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、眼睛的病如果是虚劳底，先医虚劳；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-xthwaz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-xthwaz0","updated":"20231008150144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、脏腑别通理论（五脏穿凿论），曰："}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-61hmilc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-61hmilc","updated":"20231008150144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心 与 胆相通-一心病怔忡，宜温胆为主;胆病战栗癫狂，宜补心为主肝与大肠相通肝病宜疏通大肠，大肠病宜平肝经为主"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uovsg83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uovsg83","updated":"20231008150249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾与小肠相通脾病宜泻小肠火，小肠病宜润脾土为主"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8a59878","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8a59878","updated":"20231008150250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺与膀胱相通肺病宜清利膀胱水，后用分利清浊 ;膀胱病宜清肺气为主，兼用吐法"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-oiuv12u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-oiuv12u","updated":"20231008150251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾与三焦相通肾病宜调和三焦，三焦病宜补肾为主。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8uxklpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8uxklpa","updated":"20231008150252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃与命门相通津液胃虚，宜大补右肾。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4kkge9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4kkge9s","updated":"20231008150308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、巴豆属热性泻药，且巴豆的油有强烈腐蚀性，滴到皮肤或口腔，会让肉烧伤灼烂；巴豆最凶猛的力道在它的油，皮的药性是很热的。----JT"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0aoys37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0aoys37","updated":"20231008150309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、巴豆吃多了解法：绿豆汁、黄豆浆、黄连煮水；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lkvtamt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lkvtamt","updated":"20231008150330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"长期吃中药保养，要考虑甘草独大的问题，长期摄入甘草比重量大的方，会发现人血里面钙开始降低，会导致人容易神经质，一点小事就紧张的不行，所以给老人开方时，要考虑甘草独大的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1vhxbnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1vhxbnj","updated":"20231008150313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、三阳合病，从少阳治；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uawz5zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uawz5zc","updated":"20231008150314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、三大泻心汤：生姜泻心汤（偏水毒之邪）、半夏泻心汤（偏痰饮之邪）、甘草泻心汤（偏脾胃虚）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-xvfdr4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-xvfdr4q","updated":"20231008150332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、桂枝系跟赤石脂系的药是反药，精确讲法叫做畏药；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-p4oj954","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-p4oj954","updated":"20231008150333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、李可提倡的三畏汤：人参跟五灵脂（胃溃疡和消化问题）、公丁香、郁金、肉桂、赤石脂；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4h3xjjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4h3xjjz","updated":"20231008150453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"镇肝药最具有力量的，代赭石；疏肝药最具有力量的，羚羊角"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-q292a6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-q292a6v","updated":"20231008150457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩汤——万世治痢之祖方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"："}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-j2ujdp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-j2ujdp3","updated":"20231008150336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、太阳病的桂枝证，根本跟太阴是表里关系，所以桂枝汤证要陷到太阴病是非常容易的。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5jonym2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5jonym2","updated":"20231008150338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、阳明病寒症一：阳明病，若能食，名中风；不能食，名中寒。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-n0en96d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-n0en96d","updated":"20231008150339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.1、阳明病寒症二：阳明病，不能食，攻其热必哕。所以然者，其人本虚，胃中冷故也。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-nryqy7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-nryqy7a","updated":"20231008150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.2、阳明病寒症三：阳明病，反无汗，而小便利，二三日呕而咳，手足厥者，必苦头痛；若不咳、不呕、手足不厥者，头不痛。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mazp5ap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mazp5ap","updated":"20231008150343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.3、风为阳邪，寒为阴邪"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ydxulgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ydxulgp","updated":"20231008150502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、阳明禁忌一：伤寒呕多，虽有阳明证，不可攻之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-koghahx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-koghahx","updated":"20231008150503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147.1、阳明禁忌二：阳明病，心下鞭满者，不可攻之。攻之，利遂不止者死，利止者愈。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-y1zax39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-y1zax39","updated":"20231008150504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、三大承气汤特点：调胃承气汤力道在于泻热；小承气汤力道在于通便；大承气汤力道在于中心轴的热邪；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-jwyvbnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-jwyvbnq","updated":"20231008150737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老人或小孩得大承气汤证时，换三一承气汤不容易被伤到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-iaimab1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-iaimab1","updated":"20231008150506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、白虎汤禁忌：阳明病有表证，需先解太阳表证再解阳明症，否则服白虎汤会束住邪气于体内。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lyqlmn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lyqlmn3","updated":"20231008150757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"化石药（五金）：鸡内金、金钱草、海金沙、金铃子、郁金"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7i59hrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7i59hrw","updated":"20231008150801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、吴茱萸汤用错，用真武汤救；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-b4ny2wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-b4ny2wc","updated":"20231008150802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、脾约：约可以理解为节约的约，就是脾处于一个限水的状态；肠子本来会分泌一些液体让大便能够滑动，如果分泌少了导致大便干，就是脾约；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5imm9u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5imm9u8","updated":"20231008150803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、小孩子便秘常常生白术较有效，女人便秘常常芍药较有效，老人便秘常常肉苁蓉有效；现代多数人脾胃湿冷，便秘吃吴茱萸较有效；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-c3f80nf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-c3f80nf","updated":"20231008150846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"杂病的疸病，分为谷疸、黑疸、酒疸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-c7dixwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-c7dixwb","updated":"20231008150848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"谷疸：吃东西塞住形成的疸病，代表方剂茵陈蒿汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-t07mwhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-t07mwhb","updated":"20231008150850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黑疸：黄疸又虚劳，逐渐形成黑疸；方剂硝矾散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ncx8qgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ncx8qgr","updated":"20231008150851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"酒疸：喝酒后湿热之气形成的黄疸；方剂栀子大黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lxcdbz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lxcdbz9","updated":"20231008150807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、中医界有一个俗话，就是大柴胡汤用的时候越痛越有效；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-u151ge0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-u151ge0","updated":"20231008150808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、头发为血之余；眉毛为气之余；胡子为肾之余；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-tw33q5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-tw33q5y","updated":"20231008150904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"土茯苓能够剔骨搜风，在现代中医世界是脑瘤的特效药，邪气在脑，土茯苓能够从中将邪气逼出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-l6o12tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-l6o12tf","updated":"20231008150809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、朱砂化学成分是硫化汞，就是硫磺跟水银加在一起的化合物；中国人认为硫磺是很阳的东西，水银很阴，所以中国人联想朱砂是一个阴阳相抱之物，有粘合阴阳的效果；如离魂症的人，佩戴朱砂饰品能起到治愈效果；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-bcfb649","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-bcfb649","updated":"20231008150810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、补厥阴血分之不足的代表方子——当归生姜羊肉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2c249q0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2c249q0","updated":"20231008150811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、太阴和阳明两种病，几乎可以说是表里关系；——JT"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dwkhdal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dwkhdal","updated":"20231008150930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、少阴不可汗解；少阳不可汗、吐、下，要用和解法；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0mh9t1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0mh9t1h","updated":"20231008150945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厥逆：人是冷的手脚缩起来；厥寒：手脚冰冷，本人不知"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7pcy2a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7pcy2a8","updated":"20231008150931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、木通外号导赤，泻心火；桑白皮外号泻白，泻肺火；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-pdxnds6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-pdxnds6","updated":"20231008150932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、以心肾来说，心里头的火为君火，肾与三焦的火，为相火。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-q0v84t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-q0v84t9","updated":"20231008150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、少阴，脉沉，下利清谷，用四逆汤；少阴，水泻，无脉，用白通汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-76oym9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-76oym9f","updated":"20231008151033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参在张仲景的药法里面是滋阴药，不是补阳药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-sg72ym4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-sg72ym4","updated":"20231008151037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"补督脉的药：鹿茸；补任脉的药：龟板"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-m0nt6e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-m0nt6e7","updated":"20231008150936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、新鲜的白头翁，是非常强的抗癌剂；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-u1pa1fv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-u1pa1fv","updated":"20231008150937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、小便尿不出来的叫做淋病；小便一滴一滴出来的状态；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-nzuubff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-nzuubff","updated":"20231008151100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏仁可以说一味可以松筋的药，如果是抽筋或风湿类造成的手脚筋缩之类的问题，可用单味薏仁，如一次150公克开下去，几乎都松的开"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8o22mly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8o22mly","updated":"20231008151046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、中暑分为阳暑跟阴暑；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0ppo8hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0ppo8hj","updated":"20231008151047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171.1、阳暑：身热出大汗，全身元气散掉垮掉的状态；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4io0iu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4io0iu9","updated":"20231008151048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171.2、阴暑：因为受冷，热气被闷在体内的状态，少汗；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-1lv0vgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-1lv0vgj","updated":"20231008151049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171.3、中暑三禁：禁汗、禁温针，禁下"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-298uswf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-298uswf","updated":"20231008151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、五劳：久视伤血、久卧伤气、久坐伤肉、久行伤筋、久立伤骨；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-dn8b6we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-dn8b6we","updated":"20231008151052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、七伤：食伤、饮伤、饥伤、劳伤、忧伤、房事伤、经络营卫气伤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-liqvj74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-liqvj74","updated":"20231008151142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、六急：气极、血极、筋极、骨极、肌极、精极；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-p8tid4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-p8tid4d","updated":"20231008151143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、五邪：风邪、寒邪、湿邪、雾邪、谷饪之邪；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-lgvcfcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-lgvcfcb","updated":"20231008151144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、百合病：百合病者，百脉一宗，悉致其病也。意欲食，复不能食，常默默，欲卧不能卧，欲行不能行，饮食或有美时，或有不欲闻食臭时，如寒无寒，如热无热，口苦，小便赤，诸药不能治，得药则剧吐利，如有神灵者，身形如和，其脉微数。每溺时头痛者，六十日乃愈；若溺时头不痛，淅淅然者，四十日愈；若溺时快然，但头眩者，二十日愈；其证或未病而预见，或病四、五日始见，或病至二十日，或一月后见者，各随其证，依法治之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7ih592y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7ih592y","updated":"20231008151146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、百合病治疗原则：百合病，见于阴者，以阳法救之；见于阳者，以阴法救之。见阳攻阴，复发其汗，此为逆；见阴攻阳，乃复下之，此亦为逆。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0by4f40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0by4f40","updated":"20231008151204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、狐惑：狐惑之为病，状如伤寒，默默欲眠，目不得闭，卧起不安。蚀于喉为惑，蚀于阴为狐。不欲饮食，恶闻食臭，其面目乍赤、乍黑、乍白。蚀于上部则声嗄，甘草泻心汤主之；蚀于下部则咽干，苦参汤洗之；蚀于肛者，雄黄熏之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-yv76zzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-yv76zzh","updated":"20231008151205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179.1、张仲景定义狐惑病：烂口腔的叫做惑病，烂下体的叫做狐病；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-0d5acx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-0d5acx3","updated":"20231008151206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、苦参中毒，可用生蛋白或浓茶解；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-3ce5hjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-3ce5hjq","updated":"20231008151206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、解雄黄毒：生甘草煮水、绿豆煮水、防己煮水；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-wrn0h02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-wrn0h02","updated":"20231008151317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴阳毒：毒气往外散的是阳毒，毒气往里钻的是阴毒；---黎庇留；阴毒升麻鳖甲汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fpsxfr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fpsxfr8","updated":"20231008151208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182.1、阳毒：面赤斑斑如锦纹；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-uei8bww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-uei8bww","updated":"20231008151254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182.2、阴毒：面目青，身痛如被杖；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-09frnrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-09frnrf","updated":"20231008151255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、鳖甲这个药，打成粉或做成丸，效果会比较好；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-ow5iqtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-ow5iqtx","updated":"20231008151334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃鳖时，不可吃苋菜；如误服，可通过喝白马尿解"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-wnk4wft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-wnk4wft","updated":"20231008151257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、癫痫：小孩子十岁以下叫做痫；十岁以上叫做癫；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8qyf4l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8qyf4l9","updated":"20231008151258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、少阳关键词：往来寒热；口苦；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-kksigwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-kksigwm","updated":"20231008151258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、截疟常识：截疟药等到寒热发了三五次之后才截，要等疟病周期变整齐了才好截，太早截跟病邪搅在一起，就不容易好；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-vawbyt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-vawbyt2","updated":"20231008151259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、痰饮病：痰饮、悬饮、溢饮、支饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fhtdla7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fhtdla7","updated":"20231008151300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.1、痰饮：水于体内漏到肚子里，称之为痰饮，或叫留饮；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-yd70ynj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-yd70ynj","updated":"20231008151302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.2、悬饮：悬挂于如胸腔、肋膜的痰，叫做悬饮；（十枣汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-fvnhrus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-fvnhrus","updated":"20231008151301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.3、溢饮：痰饮跑到手脚去或水流向比较远的身体部位，称之为溢饮；（冰水喝太多，造成运动过后手脚痛；小青龙汤，大青龙汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-z8jpz9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-z8jpz9g","updated":"20231008151402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.4、支饮：指向性较强，其他饮都是扯到的感觉，支饮则是哽到塞住的身体感；（代表方：木防己汤、泽泻汤、苓桂术甘汤、厚朴大黄汤、葶苈大枣泻肺汤、小半夏汤、小半夏加茯苓汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-n7ndr0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-n7ndr0a","updated":"20231008151404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.5、通常痰饮、水毒体质的人，他会有黑眼圈；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-6u2kbw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-6u2kbw3","updated":"20231008151405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.6、饮病弦脉居多，如果体内痰饮较少，则也能把到滑脉；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-mmue3bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-mmue3bi","updated":"20231008151406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.7、多次辩证开方无用或久病可从痰饮治；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-14r6phq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-14r6phq","updated":"20231008151407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、五脏水：水在心，则心下坚筑，短气，恶水不欲饮；水在肺，必吐涎沫，欲饮水；水在脾，则少气身重；水在肝，则胁下支满，嚏则胁痛；水在肾，则心下悸；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8j65x0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8j65x0p","updated":"20231008151456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.1、水在心，一开始可以用苓桂术甘汤，更严重可考虑木防己汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-qny5kh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-qny5kh2","updated":"20231008151457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.2、水在肺，小青龙汤，甘草干姜汤（肺冷），炙甘草汤（肺萎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-roe176j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-roe176j","updated":"20231008151457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.3、水在脾；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2b1b79h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2b1b79h","updated":"20231008151458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.4、水在肝；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-8a7onwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-8a7onwg","updated":"20231008151459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.5、水在肾；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-7hurqoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-7hurqoz","updated":"20231008151459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、心下有留饮，其人必背寒冷如掌大，咳则肋下痛引缺盆；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-4b8ue2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-4b8ue2f","updated":"20231008151500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189.1、胸中有留饮，其人必短气而渴，四肢历节痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-v2azicn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-v2azicn","updated":"20231008151501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、水病：风水、皮水、正水、石水、黄汗；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-f0rd5md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-f0rd5md","updated":"20231008151533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.1、风水最表，皮水是里面一层，正水又更里面一层，石水再更里面一层；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-2nc22vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-2nc22vz","updated":"20231008151534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.2、风水脉浮恶风，其证骨节疼痛；皮水脉浮胕肿，按之没指，不恶风，腹如鼓，不渴，当发其汗；正水脉沉迟，其证喘；石水脉自沉，其证腹满不喘，当利其小便；黄汗脉沉迟，其证发热，胸满，四肢头面肿，久不愈，必致痈脓；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-gi3ehoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-gi3ehoy","updated":"20231008151608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、风水代表方：防己黄芪汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-l72tvej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-l72tvej","updated":"20231008151609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、《千金方》：水有十种，不可治者有五，第一唇黑伤肝，第二缺盆平伤心，第三脐出伤脾，第四背平伤肺，第五足下平满伤肾，此五伤必不可治。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-5jz9tr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-5jz9tr5","updated":"20231008151610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、水肿病与五脏的关系："}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-otsr43v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-otsr43v","updated":"20231008151611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心水为病，其身重而少气，不得卧，烦躁，阴肿；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-z7pogiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-z7pogiv","updated":"20231008151614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝水为病，其腹大，不能自转侧，胁下痛，津液微生，小便续通；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-r79adbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-r79adbz","updated":"20231008151614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺水为病，其身肿，小便难，时时鸭溏；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-tkw55wb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-tkw55wb","updated":"20231008151615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脾水为病，其腹大，四肢苦重，津液不生，但苦少气，小便难；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-98cvcp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-98cvcp0","updated":"20231008151616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾水为病，其腹大，脐肿，腰痛，不行溺，阴下湿如牛鼻汗，其足逆冷，面反瘦；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-legzw0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-legzw0u","updated":"20231008151725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"194、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"人体血分的毒常常堆在委中穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-c47hu95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-c47hu95","updated":"20231008151721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"195、中风之为病，当半身不遂，或但臂不遂者，此为痹，脉微而数，中风使然。"}]},{"ID":"20230925145338-t1fj2eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925145338-t1fj2eb","updated":"20231008151722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196、风痱：人很虚的时候，吹了风手脚瘫痪掉的身体状态（中风）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925152334-escqdw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152334-escqdw9","updated":"20231008151727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"196.1、风痱比较对到今天的骨髓炎或脊髓骨的病，就是脊髓有病，所以手脚瘫痪；（代表方：地黄引子、大秦椒汤、续命汤）"}]},{"ID":"20230927174519-2s7pznr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927174519-2s7pznr","updated":"20231008151728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"197、太阳篇大多症和方，都关系到人体的水的分配"}]},{"ID":"20230925152255-xx58u83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925152255-xx58u83"}}]}